{"speciesId":140,"names":{"fr":"Kabuto","es":"Kabuto","en":"Kabuto","ja":"カブト"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"A POKéMON that was resurrected from a fossil found in what was once the ocean floor eons ago."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"A POKéMON that was resurrected from a fossil found in what was once the ocean floor eons ago."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"A POKéMON that was recovered from a fossil. It uses the eyes on its back while hiding on the sea floor."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"On rare occasions, some have been found as fossils which they became while hiding on the ocean floor."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"This POKéMON lived in ancient times. On rare occasions, it has been discovered as a living fossil."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Three hundred million years ago, it hid on the sea floor. It also has eyes on its back that glow."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"KABUTO is a POKéMON that has been regenerated from a fossil. However, in extremely rare cases, living examples have been discovered. The POKéMON has not changed at all for 300 million years."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"KABUTO is a POKéMON that has been regenerated from a fossil. However, in extremely rare cases, living examples have been discovered. The POKéMON has not changed at all for 300 million years."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is a POKéMON that has been regenerated from a fossil. However, in rare cases, living examples have been discovered. KABUTO have not changed for 300 million years."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"This POKéMON was regenerated from the fossil of an ancient creature. It protects itself with a hard shell."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"A POKéMON that was regenerated from a fossil found in what was once the ocean floor long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is thought 